<title>CHINA: Dharmala buys Hutchison plots.</title>
<headline>Dharmala buys Hutchison plots.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dharmala Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its 40 percent owned Quick Speed Investments Ltd had agreed to buy 417 car park spaces, driveways and ancillary areas in Wharf Road in the Kowloon district for HK$380 million.</p>
<p>The company said Quick Speed would buy the property at Provident Centre from a wholly owned unit of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Quick Speed is a 60 percent owned unit of Guangdong Investment Ltd, Dharmala said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition of the car parks is not expected to have any immediate significant effect upon the assets or earnings of the group,&quot; Dharmala said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
